static const char _zs3652_d[] = "a bare `match` here needs braces\n\nA `then` or `case` body is a primary-expression, and the two forms it excludes are exactly the two that can consume an `else`. Written bare, a following `else` would bind to this `match` rather than to the enclosing construct, silently. Write `then { match ... }`.";
